invariant: INV-36
file: build.zig
catches: test/host-builds.sh
reason: build.zig's host test takes a big-endian arm64 target, which the
  Makefile's refuses, so a Zig build for aarch64_be compiles the host
  object and cpu_cfg.h stops it. test/host-builds.sh requires build.zig to
  pass no -DCH_CPU_RUNTIME for aarch64_be-linux-gnu.

--- old
        .aarch64 => target.cpu.has(.aarch64, .neon),
--- new
        .aarch64, .aarch64_be => target.cpu.has(.aarch64, .neon),
